The '''Metropolitan Council of Castejón''' (known in short as the '''Metropolitan''' '''Council''', or simply '''MetCo''') is the highest level of democratic authority within the [[Metropolitan City of Castejón]] (CMDC). It sits in the [[Castejón Cabildo]] in the [[Centre Cívico]] barrio, within the [[Sástago]] borough of [[Castejón]]. According to the Council's Charter, the delegates of the MetCo are empowered to enact legislation on behalf of the electorate.  

